echnician-servicing-a-water-heater-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-servicing-a-water-heater-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-servicing-a-water-heater-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-servicing-a-water-heater.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Upgrade Your Home with Tankless Water Heaters: A Smart Choice for Durham Homeowners\" aria-label=\"Upgrade Your Home with Tankless Water Heaters: A Smart Choice for Durham Homeowners\">Upgrade Your Home with Tankless Water Heaters: A Smart Choice for Durham Homeowners</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">Tankless water heaters offer a reliable and energy-efficient solution for water heating needs. Durham homeowners increasingly&hellip;</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/upgrade-your-home-with-tankless-water-heaters-a-smart-choice-for-durham-homeowners\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Read More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/improve-iaq-for-a-healthier-home-durham-nc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/10/indoor-air-quality-blog-image-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Indoor Air Filter System that improves the indoor air quality of a residential customer&#039;s home.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/images/